{"id":"n70073-1-7","stage":1,"title":"잘하다 · 好","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70073-1-7-1","ko":"엄마, 유민이가 먼저 저 때렸어요. 저는 억울하다고요.","zh":"妈妈，是裕敏先打我的。我真的很冤枉啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"유민이가","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"유민이가","audio":"/audio/9f714db1c17c8ecf0221.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"먼저","meaning":"先","explanation":"먼저：先","readings":[{"term":"먼저","audio":"/audio/c1ddf2fcaeed84cd91ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54840","senseId":"1","lemma":"먼저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때렸어요.","meaning":"打，揍，抽","explanation":"때리다：打，揍，抽；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"때리다","audio":"/audio/97474f90b9c0f4d70878.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14433","senseId":"1","lemma":"때리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저는","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"억울하다고요.","meaning":"委屈，冤枉","explanation":"억울하다：委屈，冤枉；다고：重复、强调或确认所说的内容；带 요 时为礼貌表达。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"억울하다","audio":"/audio/aab6352410e5c06d1df8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15095","senseId":"1","lemma":"억울하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"c1ddf2fcaeed84cd","term":"먼저","zh":"先","audio":"/audio/c1ddf2fcaeed84cd91ee.mp3","entryId":"54840","definition":"在时间或顺序上领先。","pronunciation":["먼저"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"97474f90b9c0f4d7","term":"때리다","zh":"打，揍，抽","audio":"/audio/97474f90b9c0f4d70878.mp3","entryId":"14433","definition":"用手或手中的东西狠狠地打击。","pronunciation":["때리다"]},{"id":"aab6352410e5c06d","term":"억울하다","zh":"委屈，冤枉","audio":"/audio/aab6352410e5c06d1df8.mp3","entryId":"15095","definition":"没有过错却受到损失而心里难过而憋屈。","pronunciation":["어굴하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1a67575926ebac7fcd89.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70073-1-7-2","ko":"너도 잘한 거 없어. 둘 다 똑같이 잘못했어.","zh":"你也没做对什么。你们俩错得一样严重。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너도","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘한","meaning":"好","explanation":"잘하다：好；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"잘하다","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70073","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없어.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"둘","meaning":"二","explanation":"둘：二","readings":[{"term":"둘","audio":"/audio/ca76b1284fc2088d64d7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34869","senseId":"1","lemma":"둘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"똑같이","meaning":"完全一样地，完全相同地","explanation":"똑같이：完全一样地，完全相同地","readings":[{"term":"똑같이","audio":"/audio/e74adcf2ade3b11e71c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"52143","senseId":"1","lemma":"똑같이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘못했어.","meaning":"做错，做得不好","explanation":"잘못하다：做错，做得不好；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"잘못하다","audio":"/audio/c088e8817916a36c7669.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69936","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"039fa50765b5cd6f","term":"잘하다","zh":"好","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3","entryId":"70073","definition":"做得正确合理。","pronunciation":["잘하다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不具有某物，或不具备资格、能力。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"ca76b1284fc2088d","term":"둘","zh":"二","audio":"/audio/ca76b1284fc2088d64d7.mp3","entryId":"34869","definition":"一加一后所得的数目。","pronunciation":["둘ː"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"e74adcf2ade3b11e","term":"똑같이","zh":"完全一样地，完全相同地","audio":"/audio/e74adcf2ade3b11e71c7.mp3","entryId":"52143","definition":"事物的形状、分量、性质等毫无差别地。","pronunciation":["똑까치"]},{"id":"c088e8817916a36c","term":"잘못하다","zh":"做错，做得不好","audio":"/audio/c088e8817916a36c7669.mp3","entryId":"69936","definition":"做得有错或不对。","pronunciation":["잘모타다"]}],"audio":"/audio/56505d6583d4b49f45fc.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.665,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=70073","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":54,"sequenceScore":2.3866,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你也没做对什么。你们俩错得一样严重。","妈妈，书包太重了，肩膀好疼。","妈妈，是裕敏先打我的。我真的很冤枉啊。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你也没做对什么。你们俩错得一样严重。","妈妈，是裕敏先打我的。我真的很冤枉啊。","妈妈，书包太重了，肩膀好疼。"],"answer":0}]}
